{
  "Write the greeting": [
    [
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "AskUserQuestion",
        "input": {
          "questions": [
            {
              "question": "Which greeting?",
              "header": "Greeting",
              "options": [
                {
                  "label": "Hello",
                  "description": "Plain"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Howdy",
                  "description": "Friendly"
                }
              ],
              "multiSelect": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Write",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/greeting/hello.txt",
          "content": "hello\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "commit",
        "args": {
          "opId": "op-e2e-commit1",
          "paths": ["src/greeting/hello.txt"],
          "message": "Add the greeting"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "complete_step",
        "args": {
          "opId": "op-e2e-review1",
          "summary": "The greeting is written and committed.",
          "verdict": "approve"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "Settings: UI work": [
    [
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Write",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/views/settings/page.tsx",
          "content": "export const padding = 4;\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete",
        "text": "Tidied the settings form."
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "padding too tight"
      },
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Edit",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/views/settings/page.tsx",
          "old_string": "4",
          "new_string": "12"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "the header too"
      },
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete",
        "text": "Loosened the padding."
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "never sent"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "People: UI work": [
    [
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "AskUserQuestion",
        "input": {
          "questions": [
            {
              "question": "Which spacing?",
              "header": "Spacing",
              "options": [
                {
                  "label": "Roomy",
                  "description": "More space"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Compact",
                  "description": "Less space"
                }
              ],
              "multiSelect": false
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Write",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/views/people/page.tsx",
          "content": "export const spacing = 'roomy';\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete",
        "text": "Gave the list more room."
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "never sent"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "Chat: Why does login fail after sleep?": [
    [
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "commands",
        "names": ["/compact"]
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Read",
        "input": {
          "file_path": "src/login.ts"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "tool",
        "toolName": "Grep",
        "input": {
          "pattern": "retry",
          "path": "src"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "set_title",
        "args": {
          "title": "Login fails after sleep"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "say",
        "text": "## What I found\n\n- Login skips its retry after the Mac sleeps\n- The token has expired by then\n\n```ts\nconst retry = once;\n```\n\nSee [the retry notes](https://example.com/retry)."
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      },
      {
        "do": "await_message",
        "contains": "File the work we agreed on"
      },
      {
        "do": "consume"
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "create_task",
        "args": {
          "title": "Retry login once on a 401",
          "acceptanceCriteria": ["Login retries once after a 401"],
          "areas": ["repo"]
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "start_task",
        "args": {
          "taskId": "$task:Retry login once on a 401"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "list_tasks",
        "args": {}
      },
      {
        "do": "mcp",
        "tool": "remove_task",
        "args": {
          "taskId": "$task:Hold the line"
        }
      },
      {
        "do": "say",
        "text": "Filed it and started it. I left the other task alone."
      },
      {
        "do": "turn_complete"
      }
    ]
  ]
}
